      "message": "It may be a bit unfortunate from the usability standpoint that the names FixtureConfigureBootJars and FixtureSetBootJars are so close. At least I was confused at first because I thought it\u0027s the same thing, and I thought that it doesn\u0027t set ART jars. Maybe rename FixtureConfigureBootJars -\u003e FixtureConfigureAllBootJars or somehow else make them not so easy to confuse?",
