      "message": "I\u0027m not sure that FixtureConfigureAllBootJars is any clearer.\n\nI think that given that FixtureSetBootJars is either being used within dexpreopt package (and so cannot use this function) or has to be qualified as dexpreopt.FixtureSetBootJars the difference should be reasonably obvious. If the name does not suffice then the documentation should make it clear.",
