      "message": "I\u0027d make a regexp, something like:\n\n    \u0027^(\u0027 + strings.Join(artApexNames, \u0027|\u0027) + \u0027):\u0027\n\nIt can be precompiled once into a DFA. Not that performance matters much here (both lists are small), but in this case a regexp also requires less code.",
